================================================================================
Services and base images
================================================================================

OpenRouter - https://openrouter.ai
  Required for OmegaJev's Decisions API transport and available as an optional
  OmegaLLM inference lane. The separate page-image gateway may also use
  OpenRouter. Used as a service under OpenRouter's own terms.

ASI Cloud
  Optional sponsored OmegaLLM inference lane. StickerBook's current sponsored
  preset uses minimax/minimax-m3. Used as a service under the provider's own
  terms.

Anthropic - https://www.anthropic.com
  Optional direct OmegaLLM inference lane for configured Claude models. Used
  as a service under Anthropic's own terms.

OpenAI - https://openai.com
  Optional direct OmegaLLM inference lane. Used as a service under OpenAI's
  own terms.

ASI:One - https://asi1.ai
  Optional direct OmegaLLM inference lane. Used as a service under the
  provider's own terms.

TypeSafe Jev - model typesafe/jev-1.13, served via OpenRouter.
  The typed discriminative decision model this experiment is built around.

SWI-Prolog - https://www.swi-prolog.org
  Simplified BSD license. Used via the official `swipl:10.0.2` Docker image,
  which is the base of the Omega experiment image.

nginx - https://nginx.org
  2-clause BSD license. Used via the official `nginx:1.27-alpine` Docker
  image as the isolated credential gateway (jev/gateway/).

Landlock - the Linux kernel sandbox used by Omega's filesystem policy, via
  the py-landlock package listed in Omega's requirements.

